The completed bound is not an external replacement list: the same bounded
Boolean-atomic endpoint pair is regenerated by the same SU(7)
branch/incidence grammar after the endpoint room is raised. -/
theorem generatedNoPrimeBranchingCellOf_boundedAtomicRawCodePair_mem_of_bound_le
    {n bound completedBound left right : ℕ}
    (hbound : bound ≤ completedBound)
