    (rawCodeBoundedList_mono hbound hleft_mem)
    (rawCodeBoundedList_mono hbound hright_mem)
    hleft_check hright_check

/-- Any bounded Boolean-atomic endpoint pair is generated by the canonical
SU(7) branch/incidence grammar and hence marked allowed by the generated
no-prime predicate.

This is the source-generation half of endpoint-room completion: once the
