        hleft'_mem hright'_mem hleft'_check hright'_check hsucc)

/-- The P948 boundary pair `(3,3)` is not a P950 terminal once P950 is read
over the completed generated endpoint room `5`.

This is the local form of the active-completion correction: the fixed bound-`3`
