/-- A direct trace-lift law for the concrete generated P950 witness: every
such witness must be realized as an update-static nonzero residual of the
given Truth Formula producer. -/
def GeneratedFilteredRawCodePairHolonomyStaticTrace
    {K E State : Type*} [Field K] [AddCommGroup E] [Module K E]
    (P : ResidualProjection.ResidualCarrierSystemProducer K E State)
    (n bound : ℕ) : Prop :=
  ∀ p : ℕ × ℕ,
    BoolGaugeFilteredRawCodePairUnitPermanentHolonomyCell
      n bound (generatedNoPrimeAllowedPredicate n bound) p.1 p.2 ->
      ∃ s : State,
        P.residual s ≠ 0 ∧ P.residual (P.update s) = P.residual s

/-- A richer source-side readback for a concrete generated P950 witness.

The raw witness still supplies the bounded allowed code pair and the missing
