`no materialized repair -> scalar active-sigma static trace`. -/
theorem canonicalRichWitness_repairOrScalarStaticBranch_of_noRepair_to_scalarStatic
    {σ : ℝ} (hσ0 : σ ≠ 0) {hσ1 : σ ≠ 1}
    {n bound completedBound : ℕ} {p : ℕ × ℕ}
